Viktor 11.10.2026: «И на аудио треки в студии тоже защиту добавь в опцию и в фильтр в Библиотеке не забудь эту опцию». The take's Delete is off while it is protected and refuses aloud; «Delete non-favourites…» passes the protected by and says how many stay; a protected card in the Creator's column has no ✕; whatever the lab kept in the library or the trash for its protection is said. The shield drawn (Lucide's, ISC); the words in the six languages (19 rows). Suite (suite-1368.part); 1235's check counts the filter's fourteen ticks.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
